  "workspaceComments": [
   {
    "text": "These settings fit a laptop CPU. On a cloud GPU (File ▸ Export cloud GPU bundle), run:\nbash run.sh --set layers=6 --set embedding=384 --set context=256 --set batch=64 --set steps=5000\nThat is about the size of nanoGPT's Shakespeare model — it writes convincing fake Shakespeare. The trained model comes back as models/shakespeare_gpt.pt.",
